<section image-layout="blank" id="G7QUWdMXzz"><grid spacing="none"><grid-item id="jLYnoNS_fy"><h2>Stretch the chart, not the ships</h2><p font-size="18pt"><b>Chart test:</b> place three distant galaxies on a flexible coordinate grid, then enlarge the grid. Every pair separates; choosing A, B, or C as the viewpoint changes no result. None is the center.</p><freeform-block w="840" h="238"><shape preset="roundRect" y="8" w="382" h="202" fill="surface" stroke="palette-5" stroke-width="1"></shape><shape preset="roundRect" x="458" y="8" w="382" h="202" fill="surface" stroke="palette-5" stroke-width="1"></shape><box type="content" x="18" y="15" w="190"><p font-size="16pt"><b>Same marker identities</b></p></box><box type="content" x="476" y="15" w="190"><p font-size="16pt"><b>Coordinate grid enlarged</b></p></box><box type="content" x="45" y="42" w="1" h="148" sizing="fixed" background-color="palette-5" style="opacity: 0.65;"><p></p></box><box type="content" x="110" y="42" w="1" h="148" sizing="fixed" background-color="palette-5" style="opacity: 0.65;"><p></p></box><box type="content" x="175" y="42" w="1" h="148" sizing="fixed" background-color="palette-5" style="opacity: 0.65;"><p></p></box><box type="content" x="240" y="42" w="1" h="148" sizing="fixed" background-color="palette-5" style="opacity: 0.65;"><p></p></box><box type="content" x="305" y="42" w="1" h="148" sizing="fixed" background-color="palette-5" style="opacity: 0.65;"><p></p></box><box type="content" x="35" y="55" w="315" h="1" sizing="fixed" background-color="palette-5" style="opacity: 0.65;"><p></p></box><box type="content" x="35" y="100" w="315" h="1" sizing="fixed" background-color="palette-5" style="opacity: 0.65;"><p></p></box><box type="content" x="35" y="145" w="315" h="1" sizing="fixed" background-color="palette-5" style="opacity: 0.65;"><p></p></box><box type="content" x="35" y="190" w="315" h="1" sizing="fixed" background-color="palette-5" style="opacity: 0.65;"><p></p></box><box type="content" x="485" y="42" w="1" h="148" sizing="fixed" background-color="palette-5" style="opacity: 0.65;"><p></p></box><box type="content" x="580" y="42" w="1" h="148" sizing="fixed" background-color="palette-5" style="opacity: 0.65;"><p></p></box><box type="content" x="675" y="42" w="1" h="148" sizing="fixed" background-color="palette-5" style="opacity: 0.65;"><p></p></box><box type="content" x="770" y="42" w="1" h="148" sizing="fixed" background-color="palette-5" style="opacity: 0.65;"><p></p></box><box type="content" x="475" y="55" w="335" h="1" sizing="fixed" background-color="palette-5" style="opacity: 0.65;"><p></p></box><box type="content" x="475" y="120" w="335" h="1" sizing="fixed" background-color="palette-5" style="opacity: 0.65;"><p></p></box><box type="content" x="475" y="185" w="335" h="1" sizing="fixed" background-color="palette-5" style="opacity: 0.65;"><p></p></box><shape preset="line" x="110" y="80" w="195" h="1" stroke="accent" stroke-width="2"></shape><shape preset="line" x="110" y="80" w="65" h="90" stroke="accent" stroke-width="2"></shape><shape preset="line" x="175" y="80" w="130" h="90" stroke="accent" stroke-width="2" flip-h="true"></shape><shape preset="ellipse" x="102" y="72" w="16" h="16" fill="palette-2" stroke-width="0"></shape><shape preset="ellipse" x="297" y="72" w="16" h="16" fill="palette-3" stroke-width="0"></shape><shape preset="ellipse" x="167" y="162" w="16" h="16" fill="accent" stroke-width="0"></shape><box type="content" x="86" y="87" w="24"><p font-size="16pt">A</p></box><box type="content" x="316" y="72" w="24"><p font-size="16pt">B</p></box><box type="content" x="184" y="167" w="24"><p font-size="16pt">C</p></box><shape preset="rightArrow" x="397" y="98" w="46" h="28" fill="palette-2" stroke-width="0"></shape><shape preset="line" x="485" y="55" w="285" h="1" stroke="accent" stroke-width="2"></shape><shape preset="line" x="485" y="55" w="95" h="130" stroke="accent" stroke-width="2"></shape><shape preset="line" x="580" y="55" w="190" h="130" stroke="accent" stroke-width="2" flip-h="true"></shape><shape preset="ellipse" x="477" y="47" w="16" h="16" fill="palette-2" stroke-width="0"></shape><shape preset="ellipse" x="762" y="47" w="16" h="16" fill="palette-3" stroke-width="0"></shape><shape preset="ellipse" x="572" y="177" w="16" h="16" fill="accent" stroke-width="0"></shape><box type="content" x="468" y="65" w="24"><p font-size="16pt">A</p></box><box type="content" x="784" y="48" w="24"><p font-size="16pt">B</p></box><box type="content" x="594" y="178" w="24"><p font-size="16pt">C</p></box><box type="content" x="495" y="208" w="300"><p role="caption"><b>All three pairwise distances increase.</b></p></box></freeform-block><grid spacing="medium" vertical-sizing="hug"><grid-item id="XQGBp8BldJ" colspan="30"><p font-size="16pt"><b>The grid</b> represents changing large-scale distances in space.</p></grid-item><grid-item id="BmtdeV67EM" colspan="30"><p font-size="16pt"><b>The markers</b> are not ships crossing a surrounding cosmic ocean.</p></grid-item></grid><p role="caption"><b>Scope:</b> this analogy describes widely separated, gravitationally unbound galaxies. Bound systems such as the Milky Way are not simply stretched by cosmic expansion.</p></grid-item></grid></section>